      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "160 patients with stable stress angina pectoris (SSAP) received combined treatment. One of the modalities was information-wave impact generated by devices Azor-IR, Chrono-DMW (microwaves), Chrono-EHF. The impact from Azor-IR proved most effective as it reduced the amount of medication without loss of therapeutic activity."},
